abstract: >-
  ProofAudit is an evidence-routed research framework that separates formal
  validity, semantic fidelity, source trust, falsification evidence, and
  reviewer independence when auditing mathematical proof claims.
keywords:
  - mathematical proof auditing
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - semantic alignment
  - AI for mathematics
